            "review_title": "Review at Ilgamos Restaurant",
            "review_text": "gocegd\nBrisbane, Australia323 contributions\n1\nVery good meals and price is right\nJun 2018 • Family\nWe have been here 2 times now and we are very happy. Its hard to find a place that young kids will eat. The food and drinks is great. The traditionally food they cook here is great. Plus it is off the main road so you dont get that car pollution. The owners are very nice.they dont speak alot of english but you can communicate with them.It is a very easy family friendly place to come to.\nRead more\nWritten June 24, 2018\nHoa T\nThank you for your comments and appreciation for our restaurant, thank you for coming to our beautiful Nha Trang city, we will try our best to serve you better.\nRead more\nWritten July 8, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
